    "code": " n=int(input())\n\nn=n*2\n\narr=[int(x) for x in input().split()]\n\narr=sorted(arr)\n\nx=arr[n-1]\n\nfor i in range(0,n):\n\n    for j in range(i+1,n):\n\n        # i,j 选中的single\n\n        a,h,q=0,0,0\n\n        while h<n:\n\n            if h==i or h == j:\n\n                pass\n\n\n\n            else:\n\n                if q%2==0:\n\n                    a-=arr[h]\n\n                else:\n\n                    a+=arr[h]\n\n                q+=1\n\n            h+=1\n\n        # print(a)    \n\n        x=min(x,a)\n\nprint(x)",
